Package: cpopvar
Title: Chloroplast Population Variation Analysis
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Liyun", "Nie",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "nieliyun18@163.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5288-0041"))
    )
Description: Configuration-driven tools for analysing chloroplast genome
    population variation. The backend preprocesses and filters variant data,
    normalises variant frequencies, and provides exploratory, comparative,
    hotspot, enrichment, and plastome ideogram analyses. This development
    candidate does not include the retired Shiny workbench.
